## Goal

A sent chat message shows at once at the end of the list (`data-state="sending"`, "Sending…"), the draft clears and Send stays usable. The server's answer replaces it via `mergeMessages`, and the message shows once even when a poll lands first. A refused or failed send shows `data-state="failed"` with the server's words, a Retry (same body) and a Discard. Pending messages stay after the server's messages, in the order they were sent. Nothing else becomes optimistic. The behaviour gets ruling R2120000, and vitest proves each "Done when" item.

